      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stores embeddings in \na dedicated .vec file.\n\nMaintains a index mapping \nPK + timestamp to \nembedding id, then \nretrieves embeddings for \nvalid candidates only, \ncomputes cosine similarity,\nand returns Top-K results \nefficiently.",
